        },
      },
      {
        label: { zh: "工作流程建设", en: "Workflow Development" },
        text: {
          zh: "建立可复用的研究模板、编辑规范与标准操作流程，提升项目的一致性、效率和协作质量。",
          en: "Developed reusable research templates, editorial guidelines, and SOPs to improve consistency, efficiency, and collaboration across projects.",
        },
      },
