          zh: "支持脑电数据的端到端处理、质量控制、标准化输出和批处理脚本开发，提升研究流程的可靠性与可扩展性。",
          en: "Supported end-to-end EEG data processing, quality control, standardized outputs, and batch-processing scripts, improving the reliability and scalability of research workflows.",
        },
      },
