          zh: "开展一对一心理咨询，通过结构化提问、积极倾听和循证评估识别来访者的深层需求与挑战。",
          en: "Conducted one-on-one counseling sessions to identify underlying needs and challenges through structured questioning, active listening, and evidence-based assessment.",
        },
      },
      {
        label: { zh: "引导与参与", en: "Facilitation & Engagement" },
