    summary: {
      zh: "独立完成由一项大规模问卷和两项行为实验组成的多研究项目，考察主观社会地位如何影响行为。",
      en: "Designed and independently executed a multi-study project combining a large-scale survey and two behavioral experiments to investigate how perceived social status influences behavior.",
