      en: "Subjective Well-being, Hope, and Academic Stress in High School Students",
    },
    role: { zh: "共同主要研究者", en: "Co-Principal Investigator" },
    period: {
      zh: "2024年5月—2025年10月",
      en: "May 2024 – Oct 2025",
