      en: "The Relationship Between Parenting Styles and Psychological Well-being",
    },
    role: { zh: "共同主要研究者", en: "Co-Principal Investigator" },
    period: {
      zh: "2024年9月—2025年6月",
      en: "Sep 2024 – Jun 2025",
