---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Zhenghao Lu — psychology researcher working across behavioral research, data analysis, and insight development."
    />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/site-logo.png" />
    <title>CV | {name}</title>
    <PageTransition />
  </head>

  <body>
    <header
      class="topbar"
      transition:name="site-header"
      transition:animate="none"
    >
      <div class="topbar-inner">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Back to homepage">
          <img
            class="brand-logo"
            src="/images/site-logo.png"
            alt={name}
            width="40"
            height="40"
          />
        </a>
        <div class="topbar-actions">
          <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
            <a class="active" href="/cv">
              CV
            </a>
            <a href="/portfolio">Portfolio</a>
            <a class="linkedin-link" href={linkedinUrl} rel="noreferrer"
              >LinkedIn</a
            >
            <button class="print-link" type="button" onclick="window.print()">
              Print
            </button>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">
            <span data-lang="zh">研究 · 数据 · 洞察</span>
            <span data-lang="en">Research · Data · Insight</span>
          </p>
          <div class="hero-grid">
            <div>
              <h1>{name}</h1>
              <p class="positioning" data-lang="zh">
                以心理学为基础，理解人的行为，并将复杂证据转化为清晰、可执行的洞察。
              </p>
              <p class="positioning" data-lang="en">
                Understanding why people behave the way they do, using research and data to identify patterns, and translating those insights into strategic recommendations.
              </p>
            </div>
            <address class="contact-list">
              <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>
              <a href={`tel:${phone.replaceAll(" ", "")}`}>{phone}</a>
              <a href={websiteUrl} rel="noreferrer">leoxouyang.github.io</a>
            </address>
          </div>

          <dl class="profile-meta">
            <div>
              <dt data-lang="zh">方向</dt>
              <dt data-lang="en">Focus</dt>
              <dd data-lang="zh">行为研究与洞察</dd>
              <dd data-lang="en">Behavioral Research & Insights</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt data-lang="zh">方法</dt>
              <dt data-lang="en">Methods</dt>
              <dd data-lang="zh">问卷、实验与统计建模</dd>
              <dd data-lang="en">Surveys, Experiments & Statistical Modeling</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt data-lang="zh">语言</dt>
              <dt data-lang="en">Languages</dt>
              <dd data-lang="zh">普通话 · 英语（IELTS 7.0）</dd>
              <dd data-lang="en">Mandarin · English (IELTS 7.0)</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="resume-layout">
        <aside class="resume-aside">
          <section>
            <p class="eyebrow">
              <span data-lang="zh">简介</span>
              <span data-lang="en">Profile</span>
            </p>
            <p data-lang="zh">
              心理学硕士，有行为研究、数据分析与洞察开发经验。擅长构建研究问题、提出并检验假设、分析定量与定性证据，以及将复杂发现转化为清晰、可执行的建议。
            </p>
            <p data-lang="en">
              Psychology Master's graduate with experience in behavioral
              research, data analysis, and insight development. Skilled in
              structuring research questions, testing hypotheses, analyzing
              quantitative and qualitative evidence, and translating complex
              findings into actionable recommendations.
            </p>
            <p data-lang="zh">
              通过一手研究、实验、问卷和互动数据理解用户需求与行为模式，并具有横跨行为科学、内容策略、数据流程和
              AI 辅助研究的多学科实践经验。
            </p>
            <p data-lang="en">
              Experienced in understanding user needs and behavioral patterns
              through primary research, experiments, surveys, and engagement
              data, with a multidisciplinary background spanning behavioral
              science, content strategy, data workflows, and AI-assisted
              research.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <p class="eyebrow">
              <span data-lang="zh">语言</span>
              <span data-lang="en">Languages</span>
            </p>
            <dl class="simple-list">
              <div>
                <dt data-lang="zh">普通话</dt>
                <dt data-lang="en">Mandarin</dt>
                <dd data-lang="zh">母语</dd>
                <dd data-lang="en">Native</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-lang="zh">英语</dt>
                <dt data-lang="en">English</dt>
                <dd data-lang="zh">流利 · IELTS 7.0</dd>
                <dd data-lang="en">Fluent · IELTS 7.0</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
          </section>

          <section>
            <p class="eyebrow">
              <span data-lang="zh">能力</span>
              <span data-lang="en">Capabilities</span>
            </p>
            <div class="skill-groups">
              {
                skillGroups.map((group) => (
                  <div>
                    <h3 data-lang="zh">{group.title.zh}</h3>
                    <h3 data-lang="en">{group.title.en}</h3>
                    <p data-lang="zh">{group.items.zh}</p>
                    <p data-lang="en">{group.items.en}</p>
                  </div>
                ))
              }
            </div>
          </section>
        </aside>

        <div class="resume-main">
          <section class="resume-section">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <p class="section-number">01</p>
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">
                  <span data-lang="zh">工作经历</span>
                  <span data-lang="en">Experience</span>
                </p>
                <h2 data-lang="zh">把行为证据转化为可理解的内容与建议</h2>
                <h2 data-lang="en">
                  Turning behavioral evidence into understandable content and
                  recommendations
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline">
              {
                experience.map((item) => (
                  <article class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-meta">
                      <time data-lang="zh">{item.period.zh}</time>
                      <time data-lang="en">{item.period.en}</time>
                      <span data-lang="zh">{item.location.zh}</span>
                      <span data-lang="en">{item.location.en}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                      <h3 data-lang="zh">{item.role.zh}</h3>
                      <h3 data-lang="en">{item.role.en}</h3>
                      <p class="organization" data-lang="zh">
                        {item.organization.zh}
                      </p>
                      <p class="organization" data-lang="en">
                        {item.organization.en}
                      </p>
                      <ul>
                        {item.bullets.map((bullet) => (
                          <li>
                            <span data-lang="zh">
                              <strong>{bullet.label.zh}：</strong>
                              {bullet.text.zh}
                            </span>
                            <span data-lang="en">
                              <strong>{bullet.label.en}: </strong>
                              {bullet.text.en}
                            </span>
                          </li>
                        ))}
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </article>
                ))
              }
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="resume-section">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <p class="section-number">02</p>
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">
                  <span data-lang="zh">研究经历</span>
                  <span data-lang="en">Research Experience</span>
                </p>
                <h2 data-lang="zh">从研究问题到证据、模式与洞察</h2>
                <h2 data-lang="en">
                  From research questions to evidence, patterns, and insight
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="research-list">
              {
                research.map((item, index) => (
                  <article class="research-item">
                    <div class="research-index">
                      {String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <div class="research-topline">
                        <div>
                          <p class="research-role" data-lang="zh">
                            {item.role.zh}
                          </p>
                          <p class="research-role" data-lang="en">
                            {item.role.en}
                          </p>
                          <h3 data-lang="zh">{item.title.zh}</h3>
                          <h3 data-lang="en">{item.title.en}</h3>
                        </div>
                        <time data-lang="zh">{item.period.zh}</time>
                        <time data-lang="en">{item.period.en}</time>
                      </div>
                      <p class="research-summary" data-lang="zh">
                        {item.summary.zh}
                      </p>
                      <p class="research-summary" data-lang="en">
                        {item.summary.en}
                      </p>
                      <div class="method-list" aria-label="Research methods">
                        {item.methods.map((method) => (
                          <>
                            <span data-lang="zh">{method.zh}</span>
                            <span data-lang="en">{method.en}</span>
                          </>
                        ))}
                      </div>
                      <ul class="research-details">
                        {item.details.map((detail) => (
                          <li>
                            <span data-lang="zh">{detail.zh}</span>
                            <span data-lang="en">{detail.en}</span>
                          </li>
                        ))}
                      </ul>
                      {item.portfolioHref && (
                        <a class="case-link" href={item.portfolioHref}>
                          <span data-lang="zh">查看作品集案例 ↗</span>
                          <span data-lang="en">View portfolio case ↗</span>
                        </a>
                      )}
                    </div>
                  </article>
                ))
              }
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="resume-section">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <p class="section-number">03</p>
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">
                  <span data-lang="zh">教育背景</span>
                  <span data-lang="en">Education</span>
                </p>
                <h2 data-lang="zh">心理学与自然科学的跨学科训练</h2>
                <h2 data-lang="en">
                  Interdisciplinary training in psychology and natural science
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="education-list">
              {
                education.map((item) => (
                  <article>
                    <div>
                      <h3 data-lang="zh">{item.school.zh}</h3>
                      <h3 data-lang="en">{item.school.en}</h3>
                      <p class="degree" data-lang="zh">{item.degree.zh}</p>
                      <p class="degree" data-lang="en">{item.degree.en}</p>
                      <p class="coursework" data-lang="zh">
                        <strong>相关课程：</strong>{item.coursework.zh}
                      </p>
                      <p class="coursework" data-lang="en">
                        <strong>Relevant coursework: </strong>
                        {item.coursework.en}
                      </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="education-meta">
                      <time data-lang="zh">{item.period.zh}</time>
                      <time data-lang="en">{item.period.en}</time>
                      <span data-lang="zh">{item.location.zh}</span>
                      <span data-lang="en">{item.location.en}</span>
                    </div>
                  </article>
                ))
              }
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="resume-section honors-section">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <p class="section-number">04</p>
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">
                  <span data-lang="zh">荣誉奖项</span>
                  <span data-lang="en">Awards & Honors</span>
                </p>
                <h2 data-lang="zh">学术表现与实验研究实践</h2>
                <h2 data-lang="en">
                  Academic performance and experimental research practice
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="honors-list">
              <article>
                <span>2022 · 2023 · 2024</span>
                <h3 data-lang="zh">研究生学业奖学金</h3>
                <h3 data-lang="en">Post-Graduate Academic Scholarship</h3>
              </article>
              <article>
                <span>2023</span>
                <h3 data-lang="zh">
                  全国大学生心理与行为在线实验精英赛三等奖
                </h3>
                <h3 data-lang="en">
                  Third Prize, National College Students' Psychology & Behavior
                  Online Experiment Competition
                </h3>
              </article>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">
            <span data-lang="zh">联系</span>
            <span data-lang="en">Contact</span>
          </p>
          <h2 data-lang="zh">一起把复杂问题变成清晰洞察。</h2>
          <h2 data-lang="en">
            Let's turn complex questions into clear insight.
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>Email</a>
          <a href={linkedinUrl} rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
          <a href="/portfolio">
            <span data-lang="zh">作品集</span>
            <span data-lang="en">Portfolio</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </main>

    <style>
      [data-lang="zh"] {
        display: none !important;
      }

      :global(*),
      :global(*::before),
      :global(*::after) {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      :global(html) {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      :global(body) {
        min-width: 320px;
        margin: 0;
        background: #fff;
        color: #111;
        font-family:
          system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
          "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-underline-offset: 4px;
      }

      .topbar {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0 0 auto;
        z-index: 100;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #ececec;
        background: rgb(255 255 255 / 94%);
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      }

      .topbar-inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 65px;
        padding: 12px clamp(18px, 4vw, 54px);
      }

      .brand {
        display: inline-flex;
      }

      .brand-logo {
        display: block;
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        object-fit: contain;
      }

      .topbar-actions,
      .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .topbar-actions {
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .nav {
        gap: clamp(13px, 2vw, 25px);
      }

      .nav a,
      .print-link {
        border: 0;
        padding: 4px 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: #666;
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 13px;
        text-decoration: none;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .nav a:hover,
      .print-link:hover,
      .nav .active {
        color: #111;
      }

      .nav .active {
        box-shadow: inset 0 -1px #111;
      }

      main {
        padding-top: 65px;
      }

      .hero {
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e7e7e7;
        background: #fff;
      }

      .hero-inner {
        width: min(100%, 1180px);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 116px) clamp(22px, 4vw, 48px)
          clamp(48px, 6vw, 72px);
      }

      .eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        color: #777;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 650;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        line-height: 1.3;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .hero-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.7fr) minmax(220px, 0.55fr);
        gap: clamp(42px, 7vw, 88px);
        align-items: end;
      }

      h1,
      h2,
      h3,
      p {
        margin-top: 0;
      }

      h1 {
        max-width: 780px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        font-size: clamp(48px, 6.5vw, 82px);
        font-weight: 650;
        letter-spacing: -0.055em;
        line-height: 0.98;
      }

      .positioning {
        max-width: 650px;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        color: #444;
        font-size: clamp(18px, 1.8vw, 23px);
        letter-spacing: -0.015em;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }

      .contact-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
        padding-bottom: 3px;
        font-style: normal;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .contact-list a {
        width: fit-content;
        color: #444;
        text-decoration-color: #bbb;
      }

      .profile-meta {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 24px;
        margin: clamp(42px, 5vw, 62px) 0 0;
        padding-top: 22px;
        border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
      }

      .profile-meta div {
        min-width: 0;
      }

      .profile-meta dt {
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        color: #888;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 650;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .profile-meta dd {
        margin: 0;
        color: #333;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }

      .resume-layout {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(240px, 280px) minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: clamp(48px, 7vw, 88px);
        width: min(100%, 1180px);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 clamp(22px, 4vw, 48px);
      }

      .resume-aside {
        padding: clamp(62px, 7vw, 88px) 0;
      }

      .resume-aside section {
        padding-bottom: 30px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
      }

      .resume-aside section:last-child {
        border-bottom: 0;
      }

      .resume-aside p:not(.eyebrow) {
        color: #555;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .simple-list {
        margin: 0;
      }

      .simple-list div {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 10px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
      }

      .simple-list dt {
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 650;
      }

      .simple-list dd {
        margin: 0;
        color: #777;
        font-size: 13px;
        text-align: right;
      }

      .skill-groups {
        display: grid;
        gap: 21px;
      }

      .skill-groups h3 {
        margin-bottom: 4px;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 650;
      }

      .skill-groups p {
        margin-bottom: 0;
        font-size: 13px !important;
      }

      .resume-main {
        min-width: 0;
        border-left: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
      }

      .resume-section {
        padding: clamp(62px, 7vw, 88px) 0 clamp(62px, 7vw, 88px)
          clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
      }

      .section-heading {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 34px minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: clamp(38px, 5vw, 54px);
      }

      .section-number {
        color: #aaa;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .section-heading h2 {
        max-width: 680px;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px);
        font-weight: 620;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .timeline {
        margin-left: 50px;
      }

      .timeline-item {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(130px, 0.42fr) minmax(0, 1.58fr);
        gap: clamp(26px, 4vw, 52px);
        padding: 34px 0 44px;
        border-top: 1px solid #dedede;
      }

      .timeline-meta {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 5px;
        color: #777;
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .timeline-content h3,
      .research-item h3,
      .education-list h3 {
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        font-size: clamp(19px, 2vw, 24px);
        font-weight: 650;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }

      .organization,
      .degree {
        color: #555;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 650;
      }

      .timeline-content ul,
      .research-details {
        padding: 0;
        margin: 24px 0 0;
        list-style: none;
      }

      .timeline-content li,
      .research-details li {
        position: relative;
        padding: 12px 0 12px 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #ededed;
        color: #444;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .timeline-content li::before,
      .research-details li::before {
        position: absolute;
        top: 20px;
        left: 1px;
        width: 4px;
        height: 4px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #777;
        content: "";
      }

      .research-list {
        margin-left: 50px;
      }

      .research-item {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 30px minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
        padding: 38px 0 48px;
        border-top: 1px solid #dedede;
      }

      .research-index {
        color: #aaa;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .research-topline {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
        gap: 24px;
        align-items: start;
      }

      .research-topline time {
        padding-top: 3px;
        color: #777;
        font-size: 12px;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .research-role {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: #777;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .research-summary {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 18px 0;
        color: #444;
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .method-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 7px;
      }

      .method-list span {
        padding: 5px 9px;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
        background: #f3f4f5;
        color: #555;
        font-size: 11px;
      }

      .research-details {
        margin-top: 25px;
      }

      .case-link {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 25px;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 650;
      }

      .education-list {
        margin-left: 50px;
      }

      .education-list article {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(130px, 0.25fr);
        gap: 45px;
        padding: 34px 0 42px;
        border-top: 1px solid #dedede;
      }

      .coursework {
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 22px 0 0;
        color: #777;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .education-meta {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 5px;
        color: #777;
        font-size: 12px;
        text-align: right;
      }

      .honors-list {
        margin-left: 50px;
        border-top: 1px solid #dedede;
      }

      .honors-list article {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(135px, 0.28fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: 32px;
        min-height: 0;
        padding: 26px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #ededed;
        background: #fff;
      }

      .honors-list span {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        color: #777;
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      }

      .honors-list h3 {
        margin-bottom: 0;
        font-size: clamp(17px, 1.8vw, 21px);
        font-weight: 620;
        line-height: 1.35;
      }

      footer {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 60px;
        width: min(100%, 1180px);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: clamp(58px, 7vw, 84px) clamp(22px, 4vw, 48px);
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        background: #fff;
        color: #111;
      }

      footer h2 {
        max-width: 650px;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(27px, 3.5vw, 42px);
        font-weight: 620;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      footer .eyebrow {
        color: #777;
      }

      .footer-links {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-end;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        gap: 8px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .hero-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 40px;
        }

        .resume-layout {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 0;
        }

        .resume-aside {
          display: grid;
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
          gap: 40px;
          border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        }

        .resume-aside section {
          margin: 0;
        }

        .resume-aside section:first-child {
          grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }

        .resume-main {
          border-left: 0;
        }

        .resume-section {
          padding-left: 0;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 700px) {
        .topbar-inner {
          align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .topbar-actions {
          justify-content: flex-end;
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          gap: 8px 14px;
        }

        .nav {
          gap: 13px;
        }

        .nav a,
        .print-link {
          font-size: 12px;
        }

        .linkedin-link {
          display: none;
        }

        .hero-inner {
          padding-top: 75px;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: clamp(44px, 14vw, 60px);
        }

        .profile-meta {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 16px;
        }

        .profile-meta div {
          display: grid;
          grid-template-columns: 82px minmax(0, 1fr);
          gap: 12px;
        }

        .resume-aside {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .resume-aside section:first-child {
          grid-column: auto;
        }

        .section-heading {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 5px;
        }

        .timeline,
        .research-list,
        .education-list,
        .honors-list {
          margin-left: 0;
        }

        .timeline-item {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .timeline-meta {
          flex-flow: row wrap;
          gap: 5px 12px;
        }

        .research-item {
          grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr);
          gap: 12px;
        }

        .research-topline {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 10px;
        }

        .education-list article {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 15px;
        }

        .education-meta {
          text-align: left;
        }

        .honors-list {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        footer {
          flex-direction: column;
        }

        .footer-links {
          align-items: flex-start;
        }
      }

      @media print {
        :global(body) {
          background: #fff;
          color: #111;
          font-size: 10pt;
        }

        .topbar,
        .profile-meta,
        .case-link,
        footer {
          display: none;
        }

        main {
          padding-top: 0;
        }

        .hero {
          background: #fff;
        }

        .hero-inner,
        .resume-aside,
        .resume-section {
          padding: 24px;
        }

        .hero-inner {
          padding-bottom: 35px;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: 38pt;
        }

        .positioning {
          font-size: 15pt;
        }

        .resume-layout {
          display: block;
        }

        .resume-aside {
          display: grid;
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
          border-right: 0;
        }

        .resume-main {
          border-left: 0;
        }

        .resume-aside section:first-child {
          grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }

        .section-heading h2 {
          font-size: 20pt;
        }

        .timeline,
        .research-list,
        .education-list,
        .honors-list {
          margin-left: 0;
        }

        .timeline-item,
        .research-item,
        .education-list article,
        .honors-list article {
          break-inside: avoid;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
